\f1\b0\fs24 : This line imports the 
\f2\fs26 requests
\f1\fs24  library, which is a popular and easy-to-use HTTP library for Python. It allows you to send HTTP requests (like GET, POST, etc.) and handle their responses.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\b\fs26 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
